# Both agent folders are committed: they are what those runs actually left
# behind, so an attendee without a Claude subscription reads the same files,
# the same records and the same reports that are quoted on the slides. The
# notebook skips a stage whose stamp is already there, so nothing is paid for
# twice. Delete a folder to run that demo yourself from scratch.
demo2_car_one_agent/__pycache__/
demo3_car_multi_agent/__pycache__/

